# workspace-ops-v1 P3 FIRST REALISTIC EXAMPLE: ZDR on api.mithril.fund.
# `mithril reason` must exit 0 (CONFORMS). This is a NEW file; it does NOT
# replace test/fixtures/workspace-ops/conforming.nq (the P0 skeleton).
# Scope: workspace fund-mithril (organization), staging environment only.
# No contract bodies (Agreement names are human-approved SUMMARY labels only),
# no PII (Parties are legal entities; humans are PartyRole role kinds only),
# no secret values (SecretRef is name + location only; names are illustrative
# and must be confirmed from wrangler.jsonc before any staging ingestion).
# Owner decisions encoded below (Item 321, 2026-11-25): safety retention
# recognized as ZDR-with-exception (NOT ZDR-only; account not set to ZDR-only),
# qwen3.8-27b switched off as a default target, Norbert (Xiaomi-pinned) only
# via DeepInfra/PrimaLabs under ZDR, DeepInfra preferred with ZDR-only
# fallback, non-ZDR routes and fallbacks fail-closed.
# UNCERTAIN (not measured, must not be read as proof):
#  - Evidence nodes are kind-assertions (slots), NOT measurement records.
#    Their names say "unmeasured". No ZDR measurement exists in this repo.
#  - Term dates 2026-01-01 / 2027-01-01 are illustrative placeholders
#    (same values as conforming.nq); steward must confirm real dates.
#  - Deployment gitSha is a 40-hex placeholder, not a real deployment.
